 "frame_eqs_eel": "zoom = 1.01 + 0.08*max(bass - 0.8, 0);\nrot = 0.03*sin(time*0.11);\nwave_r = 1; wave_g = 0.5 + 0.4*sin(time*0.6); wave_b = 0.3 + 0.3*sin(time*0.4 + 1);\nq1 = treb_att;",
